@startuml formal-evidence-stack
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #B71C1C
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4

title <b>Formal evidence stack</b>\n<size:11><i>unbounded laws, bounded concurrency, dual countermodels, implementation refinement</i></size>

rectangle "Normative contract\ntyped tapes · exact rewrite · plan DAG\nordered provenance · opaque ABI v1" as Contract #FCF3CF

rectangle "Rocq 9.1\nunbounded constructive theorems\nzero admissions / zero axioms" as Rocq #FFCDD2
rectangle "TLA+ / TLC\nfinite lifecycle and concurrency\npositive models + failing mutants" as TLA #FFCDD2
rectangle "Z3\ndual satisfiability transcript\nintended laws + counterexamples" as Z3 #E1BEE7
rectangle "Kani / CBMC\nbit-precise ownership harnesses\nthree bounded proofs" as Kani #E1BEE7

rectangle "Verification gate\n4 GiB outer scope · 2 GiB Kani scope\nno swap · persistent target logs · timeouts" as Gate #C8E6C9
rectangle "Rust implementation\nmust refine the verified contract" as Rust #BBDEFB

Contract --> Rocq : denotational laws
Contract --> TLA : temporal transitions
Contract --> Z3 : consistency / independence
Contract --> Kani : bounded ownership behavior
Rocq --> Gate
TLA --> Gate
Z3 --> Gate
Kani --> Gate
Gate --> Rust : implementation permitted only\nafter formal gate succeeds

legend right
  |<#FCF3CF> normative contract |
  |<#FFCDD2> theorem/model proof |
  |<#E1BEE7> solver evidence |
  |<#C8E6C9> resource-safe gate |
  |<#BBDEFB> implementation refinement |
endlegend
@enduml
